The {{JP|'''Five-Fold Sword'''|5倍剣|Gobai Ken}} is a fan-like sword composed of five blades, created using the [[Mod Power#Imagination|Imagination]] [[Mod Power]] in ''[[Minecraft: The Manga]]''.

== Appearance ==
The Five-Fold Sword resembles a wide sword, with five blades protruding in a fanning shape out from its hilt.

== Functionality ==
Nico used the Five-Fold Sword in an attempt to reflect the [[Curve-Ball Ghast]]'s [[fireball]]s back at it, though even the sword's wider range was unable to counterract the fireball's curving.

