== History ==
When exploring the [[Nether]], [[Nico White]]'s party ran into the [[Curve-Ball Ghast]]. Nico tried to deflect the ghast's [[fireball]]s, but was unable to due to its [[Mod Power#Curve Ball|Curve Ball]] [[Mod Power]]. He tried creating the Five-Fold Sword to use as a bigger area for reflecting the fireballs, but still failed, and discarded the sword.

